{"seq":2,"slug":"distributed-transaction-2pc-tcc-saga","title":"分布式事务：2PC/TCC/Saga 与最终一致性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/relational-database-sharding-distributed-scaling/crossshard-query-distributed-transaction/distributed-transaction-2pc-tcc-saga","wordCount":2792,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"分布式事务-2pc-tcc-saga-与最终一致性\">分布式事务：2PC/TCC/Saga 与最终一致性</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一次「下单扣库存」在单库里是一个 <code>BEGIN … COMMIT</code>，交给 InnoDB 的 redo/undo 与两阶段锁就够了；一旦库存被分到分片 B、余额被分到分片 C，「要么都成功、要么都失败」这条保证就不再由任何一台机器单独持有，而必须由<strong>协调者 + 多个参与者</strong>这个更大的一致性边界重新建立。分布式事务要解决的核心，就是在一个<strong>决策点不再唯一</strong>的系统里让多个分片对「提交还是回滚」达成一致。</p>\n<p>单机事务的原子性依赖一个前提：回滚段、提交日志、锁管理器都在同一进程内，崩溃后重放即可收敛。分片把这个前提拆散了——参与分片各有自己的存储引擎，谁也不掌握全局真相。Gray 与 Lamport 的《Consensus on Transaction Commit》（ACM TODS 2006，<a href=\"https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/1132863.1132867\">dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/1132863.1132867</a>）给出形式化结论：<strong>非阻塞原子提交与共识问题等价</strong>。想让参与者崩溃或网络分区后事务仍能独立推进，就必须真的跑一轮共识（Paxos/Raft）——没有便宜的捷径。</p>\n<p>所有「轻量方案」本质上都是在<strong>用业务语义换掉那轮共识</strong>：要么允许中间态短暂可见（Saga），要么用业务预留把同步锁移到应用层（TCC），要么把协调者本身做成高可用副本（NewSQL）。三条路线的选型可以画成一张决策图：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Q[跨片写事务] --&gt; A{能接受中间态被读到吗}&#10;  A --&gt;|不能| N[NewSQL 内置共识&lt;br/&gt;Percolator / TrueTime]&#10;  A --&gt;|能| B{资源有天然预留语义吗}&#10;  B --&gt;|有| T[TCC&lt;br/&gt;Try-Confirm-Cancel]&#10;  B --&gt;|没有| S[Saga&lt;br/&gt;补偿链 + 对账]&#10;  N --&gt; R[强一致 外部一致]&#10;  T --&gt; E[最终一致 无阻塞]&#10;  S --&gt; E\">flowchart TD\n  Q[跨片写事务] --&gt; A{能接受中间态被读到吗}\n  A --&gt;|不能| N[NewSQL 内置共识&lt;br/&gt;Percolator / TrueTime]\n  A --&gt;|能| B{资源有天然预留语义吗}\n  B --&gt;|有| T[TCC&lt;br/&gt;Try-Confirm-Cancel]\n  B --&gt;|没有| S[Saga&lt;br/&gt;补偿链 + 对账]\n  N --&gt; R[强一致 外部一致]\n  T --&gt; E[最终一致 无阻塞]\n  S --&gt; E</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>一致性</th>\n<th>隔离性</th>\n<th>是否阻塞</th>\n<th>跨片写延迟量级</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单库 ACID</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>可串行化</td>\n<td>悲观锁阻塞</td>\n<td>同片</td>\n<td>单分片内事务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>XA / 2PC</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>读已提交及以上</td>\n<td><strong>阻塞</strong></td>\n<td>毫秒–秒</td>\n<td>低冲突跨库、对账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TCC</td>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n<td>业务预留锁</td>\n<td>不阻塞</td>\n<td>毫秒–秒（含重试）</td>\n<td>有预留语义的资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Saga</td>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n<td><strong>无隔离</strong></td>\n<td>不阻塞</td>\n<td>毫秒–秒（含补偿）</td>\n<td>长流程、可补偿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NewSQL</td>\n<td>强，外部一致</td>\n<td>快照隔离 / 可串行化</td>\n<td>不阻塞</td>\n<td>数毫秒–数十毫秒</td>\n<td>强一致跨片 OLTP</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>降低跨片事务比例最治本的手段是<strong>数据模型</strong>——让强关联的行按同一分片键落在一起，可参见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../rebalancing-consistent-hashing-online-migration/consistent-hashing-virtual-node-partition\">一致性哈希、虚拟节点与逻辑分片模型</a>。消不掉的跨片写，才交给上面的协议。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两阶段提交-原子提交的最小实现与它的阻塞点\">两阶段提交：原子提交的最小实现与它的阻塞点</h2><p>2PC 把一个事务拆成投票与决策两轮，由协调者（Coordinator）驱动，参与者（Participant）只落一个可撤销的「预备」状态：先发 <code>Prepare</code>，参与者投票 <code>yes/no</code>；协调者收齐后写决定，再广播 <code>Commit</code> 或 <code>Abort</code>。</p>\n<p>关键不变量：参与者投出 <code>yes</code> 之后<strong>不能单方面回滚</strong>，只能等协调者的最终决定。于是存在一个「不确定窗口（uncertainty window）」：协调者在收齐 <code>yes</code> 之后、把决定写入日志之前崩溃，所有参与者会一直持锁并阻塞，直到协调者恢复。设该窗口崩溃概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>crash</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{crash}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">crash</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、协调者恢复时延为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，一次事务被阻塞的期望时长近似</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>block</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>crash</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\text{block}] \\approx p_{\\text{crash}} \\cdot \\frac{T_r}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">block</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">crash</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>工程上缩短这一窗口的唯一手段是<strong>让协调者的决定也高可用</strong>：把协调者状态复制到 Raft 组（Spanner、TiDB、CockroachDB 的做法），或用 3PC（Skeen, 1981）在正常路径多一轮交互来消除阻塞——代价是通信轮次与分区场景下新的一致性缺陷，实践中很少单独使用。XA 的另一个隐蔽成本是<strong>锁持有时间被拉长</strong>：Prepare 到 Commit 之间，参与者写行上的行锁一直不放，高并发下放大锁等待与死锁检测开销，因此 XA 更适合低冲突、可接受秒级持锁的场景（如跨库对账），而非秒杀主链路。Java 生态里 Apache Seata 提供 AT/TCC/Saga/XA 四种模式，AT 通过解析 SQL 自动生成前后镜像（undo log）免除手写补偿（<a href=\"https://seata.apache.org/\">seata.apache.org</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tcc-把锁从数据库提前到业务层\">TCC：把锁从数据库提前到业务层</h2><p>TCC（Try-Confirm-Cancel）认为数据库行锁「太重」，于是把两阶段提交搬到业务代码里：Try 阶段<strong>预留</strong>资源而非真正扣减，Confirm 把预留转成实扣，Cancel 释放预留。以库存为例，行上维护 <code>available</code> 与 <code>reserved</code>，三条不变式贯穿全程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mtext>available</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mtext>reserved</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>used</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>available</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>reserved</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>stock</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 \\le \\text{available}, \\qquad 0 \\le \\text{reserved}, \\qquad \\text{used} + \\text{available} + \\text{reserved} = \\text{stock}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">available</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reserved</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">used</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">available</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reserved</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">stock</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Try 做 <code>available -= q; reserved += q</code>，Confirm 做 <code>reserved -= q; used += q</code>，Cancel 做 <code>reserved -= q; available += q</code>。三者都是幂等的本地事务，<strong>任意一方失败都可安全重试</strong>。相比 XA，TCC 的锁是业务自定义的轻量标记，不依赖数据库的分布式锁管理器，崩溃恢复也不阻塞。</p>\n<p>代价是复杂度转移给了业务开发者，必须正面处理三类经典故障：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>空回滚</strong>：Try 尚未到达（超时或先失败），Cancel 却先到。Cancel 必须识别「本事务没做过 Try」并直接成功，否则会扣掉别人的预留。</li>\n<li><strong>悬挂（hanging）</strong>：Try 因网络延迟在 Cancel 之后才到达，把已释放的预留又占上。解法是给分支事务记录<strong>全局事务状态</strong>，Try 执行前检查该事务是否已被 Cancel。</li>\n<li><strong>幂等</strong>：Confirm/Cancel 会被协调者反复重投，必须靠唯一键或状态机保证「执行一次 = 执行 N 次」。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此 TCC 落地几乎总配套一张<strong>事务控制表</strong>（<code>xid</code> 主键 + 分支状态 + 防悬挂标记），这本身是预留资源之外的额外存储成本。TCC 适合<strong>预留语义天然存在</strong>的业务：库存、优惠券、额度、座位。若没有天然预留态，硬造一个 Try 往往得不偿失，此时 Saga 更合适。</p>\n<h2 id=\"saga-用补偿链换掉同步阻塞\">Saga：用补偿链换掉同步阻塞</h2><p>Saga 出自 Garcia-Molina 与 Salem 的《Sagas》（SIGMOD 1987，<a href=\"https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/38713.38742\">dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/38713.38742</a>）：把长事务拆成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1, \\dots, T_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 一串本地事务，每步配一个补偿事务 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。正常路径顺序执行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1 \\to T_2 \\to T_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 步失败时，从后往前执行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{k-1}, \\dots, C_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 把已完成部分逐个抹平（如发券失败则退余额、回补库存）。</p>\n<p>Saga 的核心取舍是<strong>放弃隔离性换取无锁</strong>。补偿 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不是回滚——它是一次语义相反的新提交，被读事务看到的中间态<strong>不会消失</strong>，经典异常是「脏读导致超卖」。缓解手段有三条：把每一步设计成<strong>语义可交换或单调</strong>的操作，对易冲突资源加<strong>语义锁</strong>（软状态标记），以及用<strong>业务唯一键</strong>阻止重复补偿。</p>\n<p>Saga 有两种编排形态，选型直接影响可观测性与耦合度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>编排式 Orchestration</th>\n<th>协同式 Choreography</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>控制流</td>\n<td>中心协调器显式调用每一步</td>\n<td>每个服务监听事件自行触发下一步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可观测性</td>\n<td>好，状态集中在协调器</td>\n<td>差，需分布式追踪还原</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务耦合</td>\n<td>低，服务不知彼此</td>\n<td>高，参与者需知晓邻居事件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>微服务 Saga 常用编排式（Camunda、Temporal、Seata Saga 状态机），因为补偿顺序与超时策略需集中定义；只有 2–3 步且已有成熟事件基础设施时，协同式才显得轻。</p>\n<h2 id=\"newsql-如何把跨片事务做回强一致\">NewSQL 如何把跨片事务做回强一致</h2><p>上述方案都是「应用层分布式事务」；NewSQL 让数据库内部直接把跨片事务做成可串行化，对应用暴露普通 <code>BEGIN/COMMIT</code>。三条技术路线：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Percolator（Google, OSDI 2010，<a href=\"https://www.usenix.org/legacy/event/osdi10/tech/full_papers/Peng.pdf\">usenix.org</a>）</strong>：在 Bigtable 之上用「主锁 + 次锁 + 时间戳」实现快照隔离。事务开始时从全局授时服务（TSO）取 <code>start_ts</code>，提交时取 <code>commit_ts</code>；写操作先写「锁列」再写「数据列」，只有**主锁（primary lock）**的提交才算数。TiDB 的悲观/乐观事务即此模型的产品化实现（<a href=\"https://docs.pingcap.com/tidb/stable/\">docs.pingcap.com</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>Spanner（Google, OSDI 2012，<a href=\"https://research.google/pubs/pub39966/\">research.google</a>）</strong>：用 TrueTime API 给带误差界的时间区间，误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>。提交时执行 commit-wait，等待时长满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>commit</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>now</mtext></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{commit}} - t_{\\text{now}} \\ge 2\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">commit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">now</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>，使任意两个事务的提交时间戳与真实时钟顺序一致，从而获得<strong>外部一致性</strong>（linearizability 的更强形式，<a href=\"https://cloud.google.com/spanner/docs/true-time-external-consistency\">Google Cloud 文档</a>）。代价是那 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 的写延迟（Google 现网通常个位数毫秒）。</li>\n<li><strong>CockroachDB</strong>：不依赖 GPS 时钟，改为在块级 Raft 组内用「事务记录」协调，冲突时靠时间戳与 push 机制解决（<a href=\"https://www.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/architecture/transaction-layer\">cockroachlabs.com</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三条路线的共同点是<strong>把协调者做成高可用副本（Raft/Paxos），消灭 2PC 的阻塞窗口</strong>——这正是 Gray/Lamport 结论的工程落地：要非阻塞就得付共识成本，只是这笔成本从应用移到了数据库内部，并按分片粒度摊销。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最终一致性的收尾-幂等-重试与对账\">最终一致性的收尾：幂等、重试与对账</h2><p>无论 TCC 还是 Saga，最终一致性都不是「发出去就不管」——它需要一个<strong>收敛机制</strong>把可能失败的补偿与重试推到终态：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>幂等键</strong>：每个分支事务带全局唯一 <code>xid + branch_id</code>，落库用唯一索引兜底。幂等不是优化，是分布式事务正确性的组成部分。</li>\n<li><strong>重试与退避</strong>：补偿失败要重试，但必须指数退避 + 抖动，避免故障恢复瞬间形成重试风暴——第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次重试等待 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mtext>jitter</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_k = \\min(t_{\\max},\\, t_0 \\cdot 2^{k}) \\cdot (1 + \\text{jitter})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">jitter</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>对账（reconciliation）</strong>：异步跑批扫描「长期处于中间态」的事务记录（如超过 SLA 仍为 <code>TRYING</code> 的分支），核对账目后补做 Confirm 或 Cancel，这是最终一致性的最后一道安全网。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>现实系统几乎都是<strong>分层</strong>的：同分片内用数据库本地事务，跨片强一致需求走 NewSQL，长业务流程用 Saga/TCC + 对账。在秒杀主链路里塞 XA 这类混搭，往往会在流量峰值处撞上锁等待与协调者阻塞，而这正是分片体系最不该出现的故障模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>决策点唯一性是原子性的前提</strong>。分片打破了它，跨片原子提交因此要么付一轮共识（2PC 的非阻塞版本、NewSQL），要么用业务语义换掉它（TCC/Saga）。</li>\n<li><strong>2PC 的问题不是「两阶段」而是「不确定窗口」</strong>：协调者决定落盘前崩溃会让所有参与者持锁阻塞；把协调者做成 Raft 副本是消除它的通用手段。</li>\n<li><strong>TCC 把锁提前到业务层</strong>，换取更细粒度与不阻塞，代价是正面处理空回滚、悬挂、幂等三类故障，并额外维护事务控制表。</li>\n<li><strong>Saga 用补偿换掉同步阻塞</strong>，但补偿不是回滚、不提供隔离，中间态会被读到；需靠语义单调操作、语义锁、业务唯一键缓解。</li>\n<li><strong>NewSQL 把跨片事务做回强一致</strong>：Percolator 用主锁 + TSO，Spanner 用 TrueTime + commit-wait 换外部一致性，CockroachDB 用 Raft 事务记录摆脱专用时钟。</li>\n<li><strong>最终一致性必须闭环</strong>：幂等键 + 指数退避重试 + 对账跑批缺一不可，否则中间态可能永久滞留。</li>\n<li><strong>选型第一步是先减跨片</strong>：用分片键把强关联实体放在同一分片，能消掉的事务就不必付分布式协议的代价。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分布式事务：2PC/TCC/Saga 与最终一致性","id":"分布式事务-2pc-tcc-saga-与最终一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"两阶段提交：原子提交的最小实现与它的阻塞点","id":"两阶段提交-原子提交的最小实现与它的阻塞点"},{"level":2,"text":"TCC：把锁从数据库提前到业务层","id":"tcc-把锁从数据库提前到业务层"},{"level":2,"text":"Saga：用补偿链换掉同步阻塞","id":"saga-用补偿链换掉同步阻塞"},{"level":2,"text":"NewSQL 如何把跨片事务做回强一致","id":"newsql-如何把跨片事务做回强一致"},{"level":2,"text":"最终一致性的收尾：幂等、重试与对账","id":"最终一致性的收尾-幂等-重试与对账"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"跨片 JOIN、聚合与执行计划下推","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/relational-database-sharding-distributed-scaling/crossshard-query-distributed-transaction/crossshard-join-aggregation-pushdown"},"next":{"title":"全局二级索引建模与异步一致性维护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/relational-database-sharding-distributed-scaling/crossshard-query-distributed-transaction/global-secondary-index-consistency"}}